{
  "uid": "hive-slo",
  "title": "Hive · SLO",
  "description": "Disponibilidad y latencia de hive-api y hive-webhook medidas desde fuera (HIG-140, Gate 5).",
  "tags": [
    "yggdrasil",
    "hive",
    "slo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Alertas",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "mimir"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", alertname=~\"HiveSLO.+|HiveLatenciaFueraDeSLO\"}",
        "titleFormat": "{{alertname}} {{componente}}"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Disponibilidad en 30 días",
      "description": "Parte de las sondas que respondieron bien, sin contar los ratos en que midgard no tenía ruta. SLO: 99,5 % (HiveSLOPresupuestoAgotado). Mientras Mimir no tenga 30 días, cuenta lo que tiene.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "hive:disponibilidad:30d",
          "legendFormat": "{{componente}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.995
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Presupuesto de errores que queda",
      "description": "1 - errores / 0,5 %. Al 100 % no se ha gastado nada; a 0 o menos está agotado y las releases que no corrigen fiabilidad esperan (política en docs/06-monitoring/slo.md de Hive).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "hive:presupuesto_restante:30d",
          "legendFormat": "{{componente}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.25
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Respuestas en menos de 1 s (30 días)",
      "description": "De las sondas que respondieron bien, las que tardaron menos de 1 s. SLO: 99 % (HiveLatenciaFueraDeSLO).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "hive:latencia_ok:30d",
          "legendFormat": "{{componente}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alertas del SLO activas",
      "description": "Alertas de rules/hive-slo.yml que están avisando ahora.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 21,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 3,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\", alertname=~\"HiveSLO.+|HiveLatenciaFueraDeSLO\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "activas",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Sondas fallidas: ventanas de la quema",
      "description": "Error de las sondas en 1 h y en 6 h. La quema rápida avisa por encima del 7,2 % (en 1 h y en 5 min); la lenta, por encima del 3 % (en 6 h y en 30 min).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "hive:sonda_error:ratio_1h",
          "legendFormat": "{{componente}} 1 h",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "hive:sonda_error:ratio_6h",
          "legendFormat": "{{componente}} 6 h",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.03
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.072
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia de la sonda",
      "description": "Lo que tarda el /health de cada componente desde midgard, por Cloudflare. El SLO cuenta por debajo de 1 s.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "probe_duration_seconds{job=\"hive_externo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{componente}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Sondas y ruta de midgard",
      "description": "1 si la sonda respondió bien. Sin ruta en midgard (hogar:ruta_up a 0) las sondas no cuentan para el SLO.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "probe_success{job=\"hive_externo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{componente}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "hogar:ruta_up",
          "legendFormat": "ruta de midgard",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
